Note: epl-css — Tailwind-inspired utility CSS classes for EPL
Note: Import this package to get utility styles for spacing, colors, typography, and layout.

Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════
Note: SPACING UTILITIES
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════

Style "p-0"
    Padding "0"
End

Style "p-1"
    Padding "4px"
End

Style "p-2"
    Padding "8px"
End

Style "p-3"
    Padding "12px"
End

Style "p-4"
    Padding "16px"
End

Style "p-6"
    Padding "24px"
End

Style "p-8"
    Padding "32px"
End

Style "p-12"
    Padding "48px"
End

Style "px-4"
    Padding left "16px"
    Padding right "16px"
End

Style "py-4"
    Padding top "16px"
    Padding bottom "16px"
End

Style "m-0"
    Margin "0"
End

Style "m-2"
    Margin "8px"
End

Style "m-4"
    Margin "16px"
End

Style "m-6"
    Margin "24px"
End

Style "m-auto"
    Margin "0 auto"
End

Style "mb-2"
    Margin bottom "8px"
End

Style "mb-4"
    Margin bottom "16px"
End

Style "mb-6"
    Margin bottom "24px"
End

Style "mb-8"
    Margin bottom "32px"
End

Style "mt-4"
    Margin top "16px"
End

Style "mt-8"
    Margin top "32px"
End

